{57}{The Nature magicks involve those things that surround us, such as vegetation and wildlife.  Nature is, for the most part, a benevolent magick, allowing the caster to charm creatures and speed healing.  Yet it can also be used defensively, if one so chooses.}{The Nature magicks involve those things that surround us, such as vegetation and wildlife.  Nature is, for the most part, a benevolent magick, allowing the caster to charm creatures and speed healing.  Yet it can also be used defensively, if one so chooses.}{}{}{}{lf2 1}
